&lt;h2&gt;What is saas.group?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This job ad is intended to spark interest rather than announce an immediate opening. The role is for a future CEO position at saas.group, tied to potential upcoming acquisitions.&lt;/strong&gt; We are continuously acquiring new businesses and are building a strong talent pool of ambitious leaders who want to step into CEO roles within our portfolio. If you see yourself leading a SaaS business with us in the future, we’d love to connect.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At saas.group, we partner with ambitious leaders to transform great SaaS products into category leaders. Founded in 2017, we’ve built a global powerhouse of B2B SaaS companies by acquiring and scaling high-potential ventures. As a CEO within our group, you’ll focus on what you do best — driving growth, building high-performing teams, and shaping product strategy — while we take the weight of administration, finance, and back-office complexity off your shoulders. With the backing of a fully remote team of 350+ colleagues across 50+ countries, you’ll run your brand with the autonomy of a founder and the support of an experienced network that sets you up for long-term success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We grow&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://saas.group/family/&quot;&gt;21 exciting brands&lt;/a&gt; under our umbrella.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Feel free to explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://saas.group/candidate-hub/&quot;&gt;Candidate&#39;s Hub&lt;/a&gt; to get an insider&#39;s view, dive into our culture, gain valuable insights into our teams and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, don’t forget to follow &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/saas-group/&quot;&gt;saas.group on LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; to stay up-to-date on our job openings, podcast episodes, and with all things happening at our company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Profile Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a CEO to lead one of our next acquisitions into its next stage of growth and scale.&amp;nbsp;As CEO, you will own the brand’s PnL, strategy, growth, culture, and overall performance, driving both short-term execution and long-term strategic direction. You will work closely with our leadership team, board, and the broader saas.group community to deliver impact across go-to-market, product, operations, and finance. This role is an opportunity to shape the future of a SaaS business within a high-growth portfolio, while having the backing, network, and resources of saas.group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1445&quot; data-end=&quot;1575&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;1447&quot; data-end=&quot;1575&quot;&gt;Define and execute a bold, market-aware brand strategy, aligning with saas.group objectives and adapting to changing dynamics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1576&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;1578&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;Lead go-to-market execution (PLG, inbound/enterprise sales, partnerships), owning commercial performance and revenue growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1705&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;1707&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;Drive operational excellence: build budgets, track KPIs, optimize ROI, and implement process improvements that increase efficiency and scalability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1857&quot; data-end=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;1859&quot; data-end=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Build, coach, and retain a high-performing leadership team; create succession plans and ensure organizational resilience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1983&quot; data-end=&quot;2154&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;1985&quot; data-end=&quot;2154&quot;&gt;Foster innovation by identifying disruptive trends (including AI), experimenting with new business models, and making data-driven bets that strengthen market position.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2155&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;2157&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;Champion a strong culture: set high performance standards, encourage collaboration, ensure alignment with saas.group values, and embed diversity and inclusion.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2417&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;2321&quot; data-end=&quot;2417&quot;&gt;Represent the brand externally with customers, partners, investors, and industry stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You bring to the table&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2458&quot; data-end=&quot;2626&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;2460&quot; data-end=&quot;2626&quot;&gt;Proven leadership experience as a CEO, GM, or senior executive in a B2B SaaS company, with a strong track record of driving growth and building enduring businesses.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
