&lt;div data-start=&quot;2629&quot; data-end=&quot;2788&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to craft and execute strategy, including successful GTM approaches (PLG, enterprise sales, partnerships) and strategic market decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
