&lt;div data-start=&quot;2791&quot; data-end=&quot;2937&quot;&gt;Strong financial acumen: budgeting, forecasting, and P&amp;amp;L responsibility, with proven ability to link financial discipline to sustainable growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2938&quot; data-end=&quot;3089&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;2940&quot; data-end=&quot;3089&quot;&gt;Experience leading organizational transformation through process improvements, operational standardization, and adoption of cutting-edge practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3090&quot; data-end=&quot;3232&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;3092&quot; data-end=&quot;3232&quot;&gt;A talent magnet: skilled at hiring, developing, and retaining top performers, mentoring future leaders, and creating succession pipelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3233&quot; data-end=&quot;3384&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;3235&quot; data-end=&quot;3384&quot;&gt;Strong people leadership: ability to set goals, hold teams accountable, address performance issues decisively, and nurture a culture of excellence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3385&quot; data-end=&quot;3526&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;3387&quot; data-end=&quot;3526&quot;&gt;Visionary mindset with the ability to communicate a compelling long-term direction that inspires both internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
