&lt;div data-start=&quot;3529&quot; data-end=&quot;3637&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and influencing skills, with fluency in English (additional languages are a plus).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3527&quot; data-end=&quot;3637&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;3529&quot; data-end=&quot;3637&quot;&gt;AI Literacy &amp;amp; Application: You actively use AI tools to enhance personal productivity and work quality, staying curious about emerging capabilities and identifying opportunities to apply AI pragmatically in day-to-day work.&lt;/div&gt;
