&lt;p&gt;This role is part of our ScraperAPI&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;team, one of our growing brands at saas.group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scraperapi.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ScraperAPI&lt;/a&gt; is an enterprise-scale web scraping solution, trusted by businesses across a wide range of industries to extract crucial data at scale. From e-commerce, travel to real estate and market research, we support companies in turning the web into actionable insights. We&#39;re currently on an exciting growth journey, scaling rapidly as demand for reliable, high-performance web scraping and data keeps rising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Profile Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recently acquired Traject Data, home of SerpWow and Rainforest API, and now run an end-to-end data pipeline: from proxy and scraping infrastructure through to structured, ready-to-use data APIs. The next chapter is turning that into one coherent, AI-native platform and we&#39;re looking for a CTPO to lead the combined 25-person product and engineering org through it. You&#39;ll report directly to the CEO, sit at the leadership table, and be the person who understands the stack down to the proxy layer while also setting where the product goes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your immediate impact in the first 3-6 months will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get hands-on with the heart of the product: proxy dynamics and anti-bot evasion, working directly with our Head of Ops to optimise vendor relationships and build up capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build real fluency in the product and the backend so you can operate as a genuine technical sparring partner to the CEO, not just receive direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start bringing the ScraperAPI and Traject Data infrastructure together on a coherent technical roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end product and technology strategy across our scraping infrastructure, proxy networks, and structured data API products (ScraperAPI, SerpWow, Rainforest API).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, scale, and develop a 25+ person product and engineering organisation spanning multiple countries and time zones, building the management structure it needs as it grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical architecture direction for high-scale, high-reliability infrastructure, including proxy management, anti-bot evasion, and large-scale scraping systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive AI and modern ML tooling into both the product itself and how the team builds and ships it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute one product roadmap across the merged ScraperAPI and Traject Data lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent product and technology to the board, and work closely with the CEO and commercial leadership to keep product direction and business strategy aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close enough to the code and infrastructure to go in and troubleshoot, fix, or challenge a technical decision yourself when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You bring to the table&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading product and/or engineering at a highly technical company (CTO, CPO, VP Engineering or similar), at a 25+ person org or larger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real hands-on depth in web scraping, proxies, or closely adjacent infrastructure. You understand the operational reality of this space and you don&#39;t rattle when a source breaks overnight and it&#39;s suddenly all hands on deck&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine track record with AI/ML, both shaping AI-powered product capability and pushing AI-native ways of working through an engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning product vision and technical architecture together, not just one side of that line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating at board level: a clear communicator who can hold their own with an ambitious, hands-on CEO and knows when to push back&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience integrating product lines after a merger or acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What’s in it for You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ultimate flexibility: We’re 100% remote. You can work from wherever you like, whenever you like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freedom and autonomy: We’re a high-trust team, and you’ll be given lots of flexibility to solve problems in your own way, with plenty of help from the team when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum bureaucracy: We don’t like to get bogged down with meetings and red tape. We like to be efficient and keep momentum steady &amp;amp; sustainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small &amp;amp; friendly team: We help each other out, have fun, and joke around.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our network: We are a community of entrepreneurial SaaS professionals that regularly exchange ideas, knowledge, learning and expertise with each other internally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off: We want you to recharge your batteries when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ScraperAPI is part of saas.group and we have a shared goal of succeeding together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What is saas.group?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think of us as the driving catalyst behind your favorite software success stories. saas.group, established in 2017, is on a mission to turbocharge promising B2B SaaS ventures, unlocking their full potential. As a Software-as-a-Service portfolio powerhouse, we specialize in acquiring small software treasures and polishing them into industry stars. With a dynamic, fully remote team of nearly 380+ colleagues spanning 50+ countries we are truly global and we are rewriting the playbook on SaaS innovation and collaboration. We grow &lt;a href=&quot;https://saas.group/family/&quot;&gt;25 exciting brands&lt;/a&gt; under our umbrella. Feel free to explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://saas.group/candidate-hub/&quot;&gt;Candidate&#39;s Hub&lt;/a&gt; to get an insider&#39;s view, dive into our culture, gain valuable insights into our teams and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, don’t forget to follow &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/saas-group/&quot;&gt;saas.group on LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; to stay up-to-date on our job openings, podcast episodes, and with all things happening at our company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t just simply offer you to “take a job with us” but rather to “join us on this journey” &lt;em&gt;to build the world&#39;s largest platform of independent SaaS companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like something you’re up for? Feel free to apply even if you don’t check all these boxes. We believe in the power of diversity and fresh perspectives to spice up our team. Your application might just be the missing ingredient!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;—&lt;/p&gt;
