&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_1c795b13c79aa7b0-33&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a hands-on, detail-oriented Managing Director to lead SaaS.group GmbH, our German legal entity based in Schönefeld&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will serve as the registered Managing Director on-site, exercising real decision-making authority, managing office administration, and overseeing day-to-day accounting operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4&quot;&gt;. You will serve as the local face of the company for authorities, banks, auditors, and external service providers while working in close alignment with our Central Legal, Accounting, and Finance teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
