&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2&quot;&gt;Run and oversee day-to-day bookkeeping, including accounts payable/receivable, document organization, and preparation of month-end closing activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
