&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,10&quot;&gt;Act as the primary local point of contact for the German tax office (Finanzamt), financial institutions, local authorities, and insurers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,12&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
