&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of leading large-scale technical initiatives that simplified and strengthened core systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep technical skill:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in modern backend development - ideally in TypeScript/Node.js or Golang, plus familiarity with AWS and cloud-native infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
